    "turn_idx": 3,
    "turn_text": "Hey, this is Trey. Thank you for joining us for a Tuesday edition of our podcast. We are joined today by someone who does something really rare in today's political environment. He actually engages with people who hold different views. And we are in an era where Republicans don't go on MSNBC or CNN. And frankly, in some circles, they're encouraged not to. And most Democrats do not go on Fox for the same reasons. But our guest today is consistently up for the conversation. He, in my judgment, has a very bright future in politics if if he wants it. But let's find out more about Congressman Rokana from the Great State of California. Congressman, thank you for joining us. I want to start in an unusual way. Tell us about a young Rokana. What were you like? What were you interested in?",
