        "text": "People are more likely to trust candidates who demonstrate authenticity and consistency in values.",
        "confidence": 0.87
      },
      {
        "text": "There is a shared understanding among politicians that personal sacrifice in service of principles is admirable.",
        "confidence": 0.86
      },
      {
        "text": "A political defeat does not necessarily equate to professional failure.",
        "confidence": 0.85
      },
      {
        "text": "The Democratic Party values internal cohesion and rewards those who build long-term credibility.",
