  {
    "episode_id": 89151,
    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/8/9/89151.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 20,
    "turn_text": "All right, keeping with the theme that most of our most of our listeners have never run for office probably won't run for office, but they have suffered setbacks. They have suffered disappointments. So you ran and according to your words, you got killed. I mean, I look, it's hard to run against any come, but you said you got killed, but yet you ran again. So what was it about that loss that did not demoralize you such that you said, look, I don't want to go through that again.",
