        "confidence": 0.93
      },
      {
        "text": "I loved running despite the challenges involved.",
        "confidence": 0.92
      },
      {
        "text": "I do not take my position in Congress for granted on any day.",
        "confidence": 0.91
      },
      {
        "text": "Representing the U.S. Congress feels like winning the ultimate lottery.",
