  {
    "episode_id": 89151,
    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/8/9/89151.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 31,
    "turn_text": "You trust me, you do. You're a deep thinkers. I'll ask you a deep question. We are a nation of laws, not men and women is what they tell us. What do we do with a law that we believe is unjust? I think there was a debate between Lon Fuller and HLA Hart about your positivism within Euroberg trials. They said we were following the law. You have an unjust law. Number one, I guess, in your mind, who determines just and what is the role of the law if we think the law is unjust?",
